    {
      "id": "lst_40b0906c",
      "name": "Vision",
      "description": "Image reading for Hermes (auxiliary.vision). Addressed as `auto - Vision`, which serves this chain WITHOUT changing the active list. Every entry was verified by sending a real PNG and requiring the colour back — a text-only model answers 400 and Hermes silently 'sees' nothing.",
