      "name": "Judge",
      "description": "Inline approval judge (auxiliary.approval). Addressed as `auto - Judge`. Called with max_tokens=16, so every entry here is verified to return one WORD at that budget — a reasoning model returns empty content and turns every flagged command into an ESCALATE, which in a headless gateway is a dead stop.",
